
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "NaranAbout";
}

<div class="sub-banner overview-bgi">

    <div class="overlay">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="breadcrumb-area">
                <h2 style="color:#fff">
                    Discover Naran Valley <br />
                    Popular Places to Visit & Exciting Activities Near Mount Feast Hotel
                </h2>
               
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Popular places start -->
<div class="popular-places comon-slick content-area" id="Popular">
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Main title -->
        <div class="main-title-2">
            <h1> Explore the Best Places to Visit in<span> Naran with Mount Feast Hotel </span></h1>
            <p>
                Enjoy the most out of nature by taking a hike through the nearby
                Mountains to see species and appreciate the Valley's natural splendor.
            </p>
            <div class="title-border">
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
                <div class="title-border-inner"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="slick row wow fadeInUp delay-04s"
             data-slick='{"slidesToShow": 3, "responsive":[{"breakpoint": 1024,"settings":{"slidesToShow": 2}}, {"breakpoint": 768,"settings":{"slidesToShow": 1}}]}'>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Hiking.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Hiking to Lake Saif-ul-Malook</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Around 14 kilometers from Naran is the Saif-ul-Malook Lake. Also,
                            physically strong people should attempt the hike from Naran to the
                            Lake, which takes approximately 4 to 6 hours and includes a
                            3,000-foot ascent. It is an eight-kilometer hiking trail. Tourists
                            may hire a jeep in the bazaar and be at the summit in under one
                            hour. Stunning glaciers that provide crystal clear water surround
                            the Lake and offer a magnificent view.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Hiking Anso.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Hiking to Ansoo Lake</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            One-day trek to Ansoo Lake takes about 7 to 9 hours from Saif
                            Malook Lake. Departure in the early morning hours is more feasible
                            for the hikers. The best option for tourists is to stay the night
                            at Saif ul Malook Lake and begin your journey as soon as possible.
                            It's convenient to break this height into two sections. The first
                            section leads to Malika Parbat's base camp along a slope on the
                            river's edge. The second most challenging section is from Malika
                            Parbat base camp to Lake Ansoo.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Fishing.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Fishing</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Tourists can also enjoy exquisite trout at Saif-ul-Malook. Fishing
                            is a fun activity at River Kunhar and Saif-ul-Malook. Most
                            visitors enjoy fishing in the pristine waters of Saif ul Malook
                            because the Lake is abundant with brown and rainbow salmon fish.
                            The Shinu or Naran Fisheries Departments can issue permits for
                            fishing.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Rafting.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Rafting at Kunhar River</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Rafting is a thrilling and pleasant water sport that people of all
                            expertise can hold if adequately guided and instructed. During the
                            boat trip, two training guides must monitor each raft. Rafting
                            excursions are secure, enjoyable, and provide a wonderful moment.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Bonfire.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Bonfire at Night</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            Finally, what's a vacation to the north without a night spent
                            around a campfire? Bonfires are not only a great way to stay warm
                            on chilly nights, but they also ensure a good time.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Siri Paye Swing.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Siri Paye's Famous Swing</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            One of Siri Paye's most striking sights is a swing hovering over
                            the hillside that you'll see as eventually as you hit the peak.
                            You're sure to get the best swing ride of your life with such
                            scenery.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Horse Riding .jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">Horse Ride</a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            There's no more significant way to explore the luscious green
                            landscapes on horses. You can hire a horse for a modest charge and
                            ride it around.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="popular-places-box-2">
                    <img src="../Content/Assets/img/Places & Activites/Camping.jpg"
                         alt="photo"
                         class="img-fluid w-100" />
                    <div class="ling-section">
                        <h3>
                            <a href="#">
                                Camping at Lake Saif-ul-Malook
                            </a>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="member-socials">
                            On a clear night, camping near Lake Saif-ul-Malook looks like a
                            dream. There are some campgrounds here, and camping is the best
                            option because the picturesque splendor of Lake Saif ul Malook is
                            worth appreciating at night. Cottages and yurts are available
                            around the Lake. There is also a food store; however, trekkers
                            should take their food and other supplies.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="listings_no">Top Tourist Attraction</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Popular places end -->